Context()->texStrings;
BEGIN_TEXT
Let \( S \) be the portion of the paraboloid \( z = 1-x^2-y^2 \) with \( z\ge 0, \) oriented upwards. Let \( F(x,y,z) = (-3xy, x^2+1,3yz). \) Compute \[ \iint_S F\cdot n dS. \]

$BR
\{$q1->ans_rule\}

END_TEXT
Context()->normalStrings;

##############################################################
#
#  Answers
#
#

ANS($q1->with(tolerance=>.01)->cmp);


# default tolerance is .01 or one percent.


